"P3004171642" "A lot of the worst violence in the Hollows happens right here in Cherry Hills. It's here where the Trolls and Outcasts most frequently clash over territory. If you stick with me, I'll need you to go up against both groups from time to time. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Your first assignment, should you choose to accept it, is to hit the streets and put the hurt on the Outcasts.</a> We need to create a buffer zone between them and the Trolls."
// AcceptString :
"P774199255" "Hit the streets and put the hurt on the Outcasts"
// SendOffString :
"P3845515798" "If you can keep the Outcasts off the streets, it might deter a little of the violence around here. My men and I would sure appreciate that."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P777920568" "Combat Outcasts in Cherry Hills"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2925382614" "I need you to push the Outcasts back into their hideouts."

